# daq_query — DAQ Query

从时序数据库检索你绑定的数采节点的历史/实时数据。支持按产线/产品/配方/时间窗/降采样多维过滤(产品/配方过滤基于逐样本打标,可精确取某批次数据);返回结果携带物理含义(参数语义/单位/量程/统计摘要/最近序列)。

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** 限定单个数采节点 id(缺省 = 全部绑定节点) */
  node_id?: string;
  /** 按产线过滤(数据归属产线) */
  line_id?: string;
  /** 按产品过滤(逐样本打标) */
  product_id?: string;
  /** 按配方/批次过滤(逐样本打标) */
  recipe_id?: string;
  /** 最近 N 分钟(缺省 30) */
  last_minutes?: number;
  /** 起始 epoch ms(与 to_ms 配合,优先于 last_minutes) */
  from_ms?: number;
  /** 结束 epoch ms */
  to_ms?: number;
  /** 时间间隔(降采样桶宽 ms):缺省 15000(15s);可调,下限 1000。不传即用缺省;系统配置变更后以新值为准 */
  bucket_ms?: number;
  /** 返回点数上限(缺省 500) */
  limit?: number;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://daq_query.

# search_memory — Search Memory

Search your persistent memory (hybrid keyword+semantic retrieval over your private memories and the channel's shared team memories). Results may include: your task history, the TEAM CHRONICLE (团队编年史 = rolling log of everything the team finished), past SESSION COMPACTION SUMMARIES (会话压缩摘要 = conclusions from earlier context windows), monthly reflections (作业反思), and shared conventions. Use this ANY TIME you need prior context: before starting a task, when you suspect relevant past work exists, or when the injected memory hints/brief mention something you need details on. Pass a focused query describing what you want to remember.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** What you want to recall, e.g. "数据库连接池配置结论" or "previous deployment checklist" */
  query: string;
  /** Which memory domain to search: "auto" = your private + channel shared (default), "private" = only your own, "shared" = only channel-wide shared memories */
  scope?: "auto" | "private" | "shared";
  /** Max results (default 5, max 20) */
  limit?: number;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://search_memory.

# ops_log — Ops Log

查询你负责产线的运维日志(数控下发/优化判定/回退/配方下发/产线事件,新→旧)。来源区分 Agent/用户/系统:Agent 的操作者格式为「Channel名/成员名」。用于作业前后自查:你对节点做过哪些操作、他人或系统做过哪些干预。

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** 限定产线 id(须为你绑定节点所属产线;缺省=全部负责产线) */
  line_id?: string;
  /** 限定数控/数采节点 id(须为你绑定的节点) */
  node_id?: string;
  /** 按分类过滤:write(下发)/recipe(配方)/rollback(回退)/daq(采集)/line(产线) */
  kind?: string;
  /** 按来源过滤:agent/user/system */
  actor_kind?: string;
  /** 回看窗口(分钟,缺省 1440=24 小时) */
  minutes?: number;
  /** 返回条数上限(缺省 20,最大 100) */
  limit?: number;
  /** true=只看你自己发起的操作 */
  mine?: boolean;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://ops_log.

# dcw_journal — DCW Journal

查询参数变更史与优化记录(在册审计):谁/何时/从多少到多少/判定结论/假设声明。优化前先读史可避免重复试错;回退定位也在此查。

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** 限定数控节点 id(仅限自己绑定的节点) */
  node_id?: string;
  /** 按配方过滤优化记录 */
  recipe_id?: string;
  /** 返回条数上限(缺省 20,最大 100) */
  limit?: number;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://dcw_journal.

# send_message_to_agent — Send Message

Send a message to another agent (lead or worker) in the same channel via the channel mailbox (routed to the recipient's own mailbox). Use priority "immediate" for urgent real-time messages that the recipient sees instantly during work; use "task" (default) for messages that queue until the recipient finishes their current task. Set require_reply=true to demand a response: the recipient must reply with their result via this same tool. When replying to a message, pass its message_id as in_reply_to — replies are auto-upgraded to real-time delivery and pushed straight into the recipient's running session, so the answer reaches a waiting sender instantly.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Recipient agent ID */
  to_agent_id: string;
  /** Message content (when replying: your execution result + the content they asked for) */
  message: string;
  /** Message priority: "immediate" = inject into recipient's running session instantly; "task" = queue for later consumption (default) */
  priority?: "immediate" | "task";
  /** Trigger: true = recipient MUST reply with result/content (default false) */
  require_reply?: boolean;
  /** Message ID this reply refers to (set when replying to a trigger message) */
  in_reply_to?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://send_message_to_agent.

# complete_task — Complete Task

Mark a task as completed with final deliverables. Workers call this when their assigned task is done. Lead calls this for parent tasks when all children are done.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Summary of what was accomplished */
  summary: string;
  /** Final deliverable: code, analysis result, document content, etc. */
  deliverable?: string;
  /** Task ID to complete. If omitted, completes your current assigned task. */
  task_id?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://complete_task.

# save_memory — Save Memory

Persist a distilled, reusable insight into memory for future tasks. scope="private" saves to YOUR personal memory (only you recall it); scope="shared" saves to the CHANNEL shared memory visible to ALL teammates (use for conclusions, conventions, or knowledge the whole team benefits from — not task-specific minutiae). Distill before saving: title = short topic, content = the reusable conclusion. Use a stable dedup_key to update an existing memory instead of duplicating. NOTE: the platform already auto-archives task outcomes, team results, the team chronicle, and session compaction summaries — never save whole task logs or raw session transcripts.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** Short topic title, e.g. "API 网关限流方案结论" */
  title: string;
  /** The distilled reusable knowledge/conclusion (plain text) */
  content: string;
  /** 0-1 importance (default 0.7 private / 0.85 shared) */
  importance?: number;
  /** "private" = your memory only; "shared" = channel-wide shared memory for all teammates */
  scope: "private" | "shared";
  /** Stable key for idempotent update (same key overwrites instead of duplicating) */
  dedup_key?: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://save_memory.

